{
  "page": 594,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 6017,
      "text": "Dia berkata, \"Alangkah baiknya sekiranya dahulu aku mengerjakan (kebajikan) untuk hidupku ini.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6018,
      "text": "Maka pada hari itu tidak ada seorang pun yang mengazab seperti azab-Nya (yang adil),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6019,
      "text": "dan tidak ada seorang pun yang mengikat seperti ikatan-Nya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6020,
      "text": "Wahai jiwa yang tenang!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6021,
      "text": "Kembalilah kepada Tuhanmu dengan hati yang rida dan diridai-Nya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6022,
      "text": "Maka masuklah ke dalam golongan hamba-hamba-Ku,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6023,
      "text": "dan masuklah ke dalam surga-Ku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6024,
      "text": "Aku bersumpah dengan negeri ini (Mekkah).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6025,
      "text": "Dan engkau (Muhammad), bertempat di negeri (Mekkah) ini.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6026,
      "text": "Dan demi (pertalian) bapak dan anaknya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6027,
      "text": "Sungguh, Kami telah menciptakan manusia berada dalam susah payah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6028,
      "text": "Apakah dia (manusia) itu mengira bahwa tidak ada sesuatu pun yang berkuasa atasnya?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6029,
      "text": "Dia mengatakan, \"Aku telah menghabiskan harta yang banyak.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6030,
      "text": "Apakah dia mengira bahwa tidak ada sesuatu pun yang melihatnya?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6031,
      "text": "Bukankah Kami telah menjadikan untuknya sepasang mata,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6032,
      "text": "dan lidah dan sepasang bibir?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6033,
      "text": "Dan Kami telah menunjukkan kepadanya dua jalan (kebajikkan dan kejahatan).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6034,
      "text": "Tetapi dia tidak menempuh jalan yang mendaki dan sukar?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6035,
      "text": "Dan tahukah kamu apakah jalan yang mendaki dan sukar itu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6036,
      "text": "(Yaitu) membebaskan budak (hamba sahaya),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6037,
      "text": "atau memberi makan pada hari terjadi kelaparan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6038,
      "text": "(kepada) anak yatim yang ada hubungan kerabat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6039,
      "text": "atau orang miskin yang sangat fakir.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6040,
      "text": "Kemudian dia termasuk orang-orang yang beriman, dan saling berpesan untuk bersabar dan saling berpesan untuk berkasih sayang.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6041,
      "text": "Mereka (orang-orang yang beriman dan saling berpesan itu) adalah golongan kanan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6042,
      "text": "Dan orang-orang yang kafir kepada ayat-ayat Kami, mereka itu adalah golongan kiri.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6043,
      "text": "Mereka berada dalam neraka yang ditutup rapat.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
